 - A task ID that does not belong to the project in the path → 404.
 
+### User transfer (between organizations)
+
+- `{orgID}` must be the caller's own organization (else 404), and the user must belong to it (else 404).
+- Only an org admin of that organization may transfer (else 403).
+- The target must be a known organization different from the current one (else 400).
+- A user who still holds any project role is refused (400) until those roles are removed. Nothing changes on refusal.
+- On success the user's org admin flag is cleared, since admin rights are per organization.
+
 ## Seed data
 
 | User | Org | Roles |
